<div class='doc-title'>SUBJECT: DECLARATION - SOURCE OF FUNDS</div>

<p>Dear Sir / Madam,</p>

<p>
We are writing this letter to formally declare and confirm the origin and legitimacy of the funds that will be used for transactions with <strong>LBH BULLION GOLD TRADING L.L.C</strong>.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Specified Purpose of Transactions:</strong><br>
____________________________________________________________________________________<br>
____________________________________________________________________________________
</p>

<p>
The funds that we / I will be utilizing for the above purpose have been acquired through legitimate commercial business operations and trading income. We explicitly declare that the funds are legitimate and do not have any illegal origin, criminal proceeds, or relationship to money laundering, terrorism financing, or illicit financial flows.
</p>

<p>
We fully understand that <strong>LBH BULLION GOLD TRADING L.L.C</strong> has an affirmative legal obligation under Federal Decree-Law No. (20) of 2018 of the United Arab Emirates and international AML/CFT regulatory guidelines to confirm the bona fides of all financial counterparties.
</p>

<p>
I / We assure you that the funds used to purchase precious metals products are derived exclusively from lawful sources. If requested, we are fully prepared to furnish supplementary financial documentation, bank statements, audited accounts, or invoices to demonstrate the legitimate commercial provenance of our funds.
</p>

<p>Please inform us should you require any further clarification or compliance verification.</p>

<p>Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.</p>

